<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sagaso ze! Doragon Booru</i></font>

6
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:20,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go seek them out! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

7
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:24,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto yukai na kiseki</i></font>

8
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:24,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most delightful miracles in the world</i></font>

9
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:27,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

10
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:27,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:33,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:33,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Mune waku-waku no ai ga GISSIRI</i></font>

14
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>The love of a pounding chest is GISSIRI</i></font>

15
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:42,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Iro toridori no yume ga DOSSARI</i></font>

16
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:42,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Multi-colored dreams rain down DOSSARI</i></font>

17
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:49,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo no doko ka de hikatte 'ru</i></font>

18
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:49,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Somewhere in this world, they are glowing</i></font>

19
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:52,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Soitsu mitsuke ni yuko ze BOY</i></font>

20
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:52,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go on out there and find them, boy</i></font>

21
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:56,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Yokai henge mo buttobashi</i></font>

22
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:56,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>All the while pounding on mutants and monsters</i></font>

23
00:00:56,130 --> 00:01:02,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kumo no mashin de kyo mo tobu no sa</i></font>

24
00:00:56,130 --> 00:01:02,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>And we'll fly through the day</i>
<i>on our cloud machine as well!</i></font>

25
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:07,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's try, try, try makafushigi</i></font>

26
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:07,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's try, try, try, how mysterious</i></font>

27
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sora o kakenuke yama o koe</i></font>

28
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Charging through the sky,</i>
<i>while we overcome mountains!</i></font>

29
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:13,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's fly, fly, fly, daiboken</i></font>

30
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:13,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's fly, fly, fly, such an adventure</i></font>

31
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:21,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi na tabi ga hajimaru ze</i></font>

32
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:21,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Our strange little journey now begins!</i></font>

33
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:24,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Te ni irero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

34
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:24,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's get them in hand! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

35
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:28,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto tegowai chansu</i></font>

36
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:28,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most formidable gambles in the world</i></font>

37
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:31,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oikakero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

38
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:31,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go chase them down! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

39
00:01:31,930 --> 00:01:35,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto ikashita dorama</i></font>

40
00:01:31,930 --> 00:01:35,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Some of the most enjoyable drama in the world</i></font>

41
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

42
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

43
00:01:38,630 --> 00:01:48,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

44
00:01:38,630 --> 00:01:48,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:53,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Shen Long, Revived!!"</font>

46
00:02:03,130 --> 00:02:06,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will now revive Shen Long for you.</font>

47
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Popo. Bring Shen Long here.</font>

48
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:10,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes!</font>

49
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:15,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you understand, Son Goku?</font>

50
00:02:15,370 --> 00:02:18,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is all you can request
of me, nothing more.</font>

51
00:02:18,210 --> 00:02:20,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I do!</font>

52
00:02:20,410 --> 00:02:22,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here it is.</font>

53
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?</font>

54
00:02:35,830 --> 00:02:40,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He has been broken into
quite a lot of pieces.</font>

55
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:42,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Will you be able to fix him, Popo?</font>

56
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes. Easily.</font>

57
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:07,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is Shen Long?</font>

58
00:03:07,090 --> 00:03:09,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Popo makes things for God.</font>

59
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:12,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God breathes life
into things Popo makes.</font>

60
00:03:12,830 --> 00:03:18,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To tell the truth, I considered
leaving Shen Long broken.</font>

61
00:03:18,270 --> 00:03:24,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I created the Dragon Balls for the
earthbound humans' courage and hope,</font>

62
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:28,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but none used them for the sake of good.</font>

63
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:35,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They would steal the balls and shed
one another's blood for no other reason</font>

64
00:03:35,850 --> 00:03:38,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">than to satisfy their own greed.</font>

65
00:03:39,590 --> 00:03:42,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">However...</font>

66
00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:44,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...you were different.</font>

67
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I had a great deal of
difficulty deciding what to do,</font>

68
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:49,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but if people such as yourself exist,
no matter how few their number may be,</font>

69
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:54,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no qualms with reviving
the Dragon Balls once more.</font>

70
00:03:59,850 --> 00:04:01,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All fixed!</font>

71
00:04:05,290 --> 00:04:07,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stand away from it.</font>

72
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes.</font>

73
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:13,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You stand back too.</font>

74
00:04:13,270 --> 00:04:14,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay.</font>

75
00:05:08,790 --> 00:05:10,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's going somewhere!</font>

76
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:14,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He is returning to the Dragon Balls.</font>

77
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:19,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Normally, they transform into
stone balls for one full year,</font>

78
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:23,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but this time I will make an exception
and allow a wish to be granted right away.</font>

79
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:25,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?</font>

80
00:05:28,170 --> 00:05:31,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can I go see everyone come back to life?</font>

81
00:05:31,010 --> 00:05:34,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You made a promise that you
would remain here and train.</font>

82
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:36,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah...</font>

83
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:38,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You will endure for three years,</font>

84
00:05:38,550 --> 00:05:41,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">after which you can see your friends
again at the next Tenkaichi Budokai.</font>

85
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:46,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Tenkaichi Budokai?!
You know about that too?!</font>

86
00:05:46,260 --> 00:05:51,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is no doubt at all... Piccolo <i>will</i>
be at the next Tenkaichi Budokai.</font>

87
00:05:51,330 --> 00:05:53,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To kill you.</font>

88
00:05:53,170 --> 00:05:54,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Piccolo?!</font>

89
00:05:54,300 --> 00:05:58,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you talking
about?! I killed him!</font>

90
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:01,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unfortunate as it may be, he still lives.</font>

91
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:06,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Immediately prior to his explosion,</i>
<i>he left behind a double of himself.</i></font>

92
00:06:06,350 --> 00:06:08,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That double has been endowed with</i>
<i>even greater strength than before,</i></font>

93
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:16,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>so that he may eliminate you</i>
<i>and rule the world once more.</i></font>

94
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:22,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way...</font>

95
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:26,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As long as you are here, he will
be unable to come after you.</font>

96
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:32,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You will train for three years in secrecy and
destroy Piccolo once and for all next time.</font>

97
00:06:34,210 --> 00:06:38,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is a reason why neither
Mr. Popo nor I can fight him.</font>

98
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:43,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The only one who can defeat him
and bring about true peace is you.</font>

99
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you understand?</font>

100
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:47,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I understand!</font>

101
00:06:47,590 --> 00:06:49,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Defeat him without fail!</font>

102
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:52,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll do it! Just you wait and see!</font>

103
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:55,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, I better
start training right away!</font>

104
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:04,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But first I need to take a leak...
do you guys have a bathroom?</font>

105
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:09,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go inside and turn left.</font>

106
00:07:17,550 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God. You and Piccolo are one.</font>

107
00:07:21,290 --> 00:07:25,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If he defeats Piccolo, you too will die...</font>

108
00:07:25,490 --> 00:07:28,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That not good at all.</font>

109
00:07:28,290 --> 00:07:32,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, he is the seed that I originally sowed.</font>

110
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:35,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've long wanted to take
responsibility for it.</font>

111
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:41,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But a God cannot simply commit suicide...</font>

112
00:07:41,610 --> 00:07:45,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have been waiting for
someone such as him to appear.</font>

113
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:52,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I am certain that this young lad known
as Son Goku <i>will</i> accomplish this.</font>

114
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:55,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Mr. Popo is full of conflicting emotions.</font>

115
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:32,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're workin' pretty hard out there.</font>

116
00:08:32,550 --> 00:08:34,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't overdo it!</font>

117
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's still three years
until the tournament.</font>

118
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:39,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I know.</font>

119
00:08:41,890 --> 00:08:43,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Only</i> three years.</font>

120
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:50,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That a Dragon Ball?</font>

121
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. Used to be, anyway.</font>

122
00:09:15,190 --> 00:09:17,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Which should I choose?</font>

123
00:09:25,450 --> 00:09:28,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll come back to life, I'm sure of it!</font>

124
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:31,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you say something?</font>

125
00:09:31,050 --> 00:09:32,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, not really.</font>

126
00:09:35,020 --> 00:09:36,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is it?</font>

127
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:57,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Dragon Ball!</font>

128
00:09:57,010 --> 00:10:00,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha! What the hell's goin' on?</font>

129
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha...</font>

130
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could it be?</font>

131
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:37,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shen Long, please come out...</font>

132
00:10:37,450 --> 00:10:40,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come out, Shen Long!</font>

133
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:42,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please.</font>

134
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please, Shen Long!</font>

135
00:10:43,750 --> 00:10:46,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're counting on you, Shen Long!</font>

136
00:11:01,570 --> 00:11:04,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's goin' on?!</font>

137
00:11:53,190 --> 00:11:56,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He came out! Shen Long really came out!</font>

138
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:04,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It can't be!</font>

139
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:07,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shen Long! You didn't die!</font>

140
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:12,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i> made a request to God.</font>

141
00:12:12,610 --> 00:12:15,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And thus I was given life anew.</font>

142
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:18,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku... asked God?!</font>

143
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you mean?!</font>

144
00:12:19,450 --> 00:12:24,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i> is training in the
Heavenly Realm in preparation</font>

145
00:12:24,590 --> 00:12:28,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">for the next Tenkaichi Budokai.</font>

146
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:32,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can ask him the details when
you see him at the tournament.</font>

147
00:12:32,830 --> 00:12:34,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Training in the Heavenly Realm?!</font>

148
00:12:34,670 --> 00:12:38,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I shall now grant you one wish.</font>

149
00:12:38,300 --> 00:12:40,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">State your wish!</font>

150
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:44,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We want you to bring back
our friends that Piccolo killed!</font>

151
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:48,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn and the Turtle Hermit
and Chaozu, too!</font>

152
00:12:48,310 --> 00:12:51,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A simple task.</font>

153
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:53,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, wait!</font>

154
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:59,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bring back all the innocent
people that Piccolo killed, too!</font>

155
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:01,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can you do that many?</font>

156
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:21,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well.</font>

157
00:13:21,210 --> 00:13:27,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will bring back to life all who
have been killed by Piccolo Daimao.</font>

158
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:04,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Chaozu!
- Ten-<i>san</i>!</font>

159
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:08,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your wish has been granted.</font>

160
00:14:08,290 --> 00:14:10,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fare thee well!</font>

161
00:14:15,330 --> 00:14:17,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Welcome back!</font>

162
00:14:19,170 --> 00:14:22,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was dead until just now?</font>

163
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:24,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's so great having you back with us!</font>

164
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's for sure!</font>

165
00:14:26,310 --> 00:14:28,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's true!</font>

166
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:34,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I bet people everywhere are in
a big clamor right about now!</font>

167
00:14:35,350 --> 00:14:37,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Daddy!</font>

168
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Honey!</font>

169
00:14:43,290 --> 00:14:47,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Chapa-o!
- Chapa-o!</font>

170
